        {
            "author_association": "NONE",
            "body": "@JuanVqz  Yes, there is a way, and this works.\n```lua\nMiniPick.setup({\n    mappings = {\n        sys_paste = {\n            char = \"<C-v>\",\n            func = function()\n                MiniPick.set_picker_query({ vim.fn.getreg(\"+\") })\n            end,\n        },\n    })\n```",
