            "author_association": "NONE",
            "body": "@krovuxdev thank you for the snippet, it works like a charm.\n\nwhere can I find more info about it?\n\nIt would be nice to include it in the `mini.pick` readme or help.\n\n-----\n\nTaking advantage you are here, I have another question, I recently was checking this [package](https://github.com/CopilotC-Nvim/CopilotChat.nvim/) and I wanted to integrate it with `mini.pick`, unfortunately, it only has some [integrations](https://github.com/CopilotC-Nvim/CopilotChat.nvim/tree/main/lua/CopilotChat/integrations), do you think it will be difficult to create that integration?\n\nThanks in advanced :) ",
