            "author_association": "NONE",
            "body": "@JuanVqz  You can find more information about `mini.pick` in the [documentation](https://github.com/echasnovski/mini.nvim/blob/main/doc/mini-pick.txt) or by running `:help minipick` in Neovim.  \n\nAs for integrating `CopilotChat.nvim` with `mini.pick`, I'm not sure how to do it exactly, but the idea is to create it using [minipick.registry](https://github.com/echasnovski/mini.nvim/blob/a84b7e555fe382c1859e6ca46b4983c822a1f77f/doc/mini-pick.txt#L1210-L1238).  \n\nHope that helps!\n",
