        {
            "author_association": "NONE",
            "body": "> [@JuanVqz](https://github.com/JuanVqz), [@krovuxdev](https://github.com/krovuxdev): although [this approach](https://github.com/echasnovski/mini.nvim/issues/1587#issuecomment-2669798252) works, the recommended way of doing so is [by using already present `paste` action](https://github.com/echasnovski/mini.nvim/blob/a84b7e555fe382c1859e6ca46b4983c822a1f77f/doc/mini-pick.txt#L727) which [pastes from Neovim's register](https://github.com/echasnovski/mini.nvim/blob/a84b7e555fe382c1859e6ca46b4983c822a1f77f/doc/mini-pick.txt#L540). To paste from system clipboard it is either `<C-r>+` or `<C-r>*`.\n\nOh, that's right! I had forgotten about that. Thank you very much! :)",
