        {
            "author_association": "NONE",
            "body": "It is me again! I found a cabiat; if the copied line includes a specific number on it, for example: If I copy `app/models/user.rb:10` it won't take me to that line in the `.rb` file.\n\nIs it possible to add that feature in the plugin?\n\nThanks in advance",
